WEBVTT

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.160
I wonder if Hiro-san got up all right.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:32.070
I doubt she'd oversleep on the day of a field trip.

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.040
Sae-san is with her there, too.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.970
Yuno-san, Miyako-san!

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.650
Good morning.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.760
Morning!

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:39.800
Morning.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.370
Yuno-senpai.

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:44.100
Thank you for yesterday.

00:01:03.870 --> 00:01:06.280
Hiro, it's morning!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.090
Hiro! I can see your chest!

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.200
youki ni kuchibue fuite

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.200
Whistling a cheerful tune

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.530
madobe no kotori to sesshon

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.530
I join the birds chirping by the window

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.450
suima ga yatte kite

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:47.450
When fatigue strikes

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.080
atama ga danshingu

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:50.080
My imagination runs wild

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.540
nan demo kan demo waraeru nichijou

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.540
Everything in life makes me smile

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.380
okimari na kishoutenketsu

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:55.380
Nothing really new takes place

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.010
demo demo tama ni wa piritto supaisu

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.010
But sometimes it's exciting to spice things up

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.630
aozora peintingu

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:00.630
Let's paint it on the blue sky

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:01.680
doko ikou

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:01.680
Where should we go?

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.260
koko ni iyou

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.260
Let's stay here

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.260
sore wa nani

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:04.260
What's that?

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.850
are yaritai

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:05.850
I wanna try that!

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.430
ima ni tokubetsu na shirushi

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:08.430
Let's make this moment count

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:13.810
tokeibari no mawashikata watashi shidai kamo

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:13.810
How fast my clock moves is all up to me

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.480
shiki oriori iro toridori

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.480
With a rich palette of colors from the four seasons

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.940
nonbiri na everyday

00:02:17.480 --> 00:02:19.940
Our laid-back everyday lives can be

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:22.570
pasuteru bibiddo metoro

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:22.570
Any blend of pastel, vivid, and metro colors

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:25.410
jibun dake no karaaringu

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:25.410
Anyone can create their own coloring

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.990
sono tokidoki mune doki doki

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:27.990
So when your heart races in excitement

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:31.710
hachamecha na taiyou ni oegaki

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:31.710
Just draw a sun at the top

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.840
tobidasu aatishizumu

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.840
And let your inner artist take you from there

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:39.170
gyutto shite ii kana

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:39.170
Can I hold your hand tight?

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.550
suki suki suki wo sukecchi

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.550
I've been sketching everything I love

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:49.090
nijiiro ni somete iku yo

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:49.090
And painting them in rainbow colors

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:53.850
sore ja ittekimasu

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:53.850
All right, I'm off to have some more fun!

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:07.430
Good morning, everyone!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:11.580
S-Sensei, are you all right?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.830
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:16.120
The injury on your head...

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.810
I'm not injured!

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:23.030
This is a net that keeps the fruit safe!

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:26.130
Hokkaido, the place where the third-years went for their field trip,

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:28.630
is also famous for its melons!

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:32.620
So I made this costume in hopes of someone bringing back some melons for me!

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:34.020
What do you think?

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.360
Do I look like a melon?

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:40.570
By the way, don't say my breasts are like melons!

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.070
No one said that.

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:49.330
<i>I ended up being no help to the first-year girls yesterday.</i>

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.330
<i>Oh, Nori-chan!</i>

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.330
<i>Is she trying to take down that box?</i>

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.960
Nori-chan, I'll handle it!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.010
Yuno-san!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.890
Why did you get a rolling chair?!

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:15.140
Wow!

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:16.190
It's wonderful!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:18.330
Hey, there are swan boats here!

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:19.460
Let's have a race!

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.390
Okay! We'll be right there!

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:22.700
Come on, Sae!

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.850
Guys, this swan...

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:31.870
Oh!

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.750
Let's go!

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.780
What?!

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:43.970
Hello, everyone.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:48.120
We're now leaving central Hokkaido and heading south.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.970
I'll be your guide for the next two hours!

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.220
Excuse me!

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.050
Can you do something funny for us?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:58.190
Huh, something funny?

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.440
Well...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.440
Oh, I'll do tongue twisters!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:09.200
Bus gas explosion, bus gas explosion...

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.200
Of all the things you could've picked...

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:16.210
Breathe in gently.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:19.210
Gently!

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:20.960
Remember to be gentle!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:32.590
Hey, look at that!

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.500
Wow, that's amazing!

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:37.980
The art students are so creative!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.620
It's so artistic!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:49.490
I wish I could be resourceful like the upperclassmen.

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:51.990
I just can't figure out how I can be helpful.

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:55.520
What should I do?

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:58.960
I think you're fine as is.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.210
How about...

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:04.110
you try doing something Sae-san and Hiro-san have done for you?

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:05.800
Something they've done for me?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.410
They always watch me from nearby,

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:12.510
and hold my hand when I reach out.

00:06:21.210 --> 00:06:23.400
I'm getting the feeling that someone's watching me.

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:25.070
What? Is a stalker following us?!

00:06:36.450 --> 00:06:41.710
<i>When that happens, it's better to wait for them to leave on their own rather than confront them.</i>

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:43.460
<i>I think I read that somewhere.</i>

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:48.220
How do you trip on a flat surface?

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:51.970
My legs got tangled because I was thinking about who might be behind me.

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:53.390
You're such a child.

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.480
Nori-chan!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:59.700
Jeez, you're so helpless.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.190
Pay attention to what's in front of you when you walk!

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.190
Thank you, Nori-chan!

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:06.900
Let's go!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:07.670
Yeah!

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.220
Oh, Yuno-san!

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.170
Ah, Yoshinoya-sensei!

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.920
Is something the matter?

00:07:32.270 --> 00:07:33.180
No...

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:36.430
It's so quiet here.

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:38.270
At Hidamari Apartments, too.

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:45.310
Sae-san and Hiro-san are both on the school trip, after all.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.030
How are things at Hidamari Apartments?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:52.470
This is the first time we've been without the third-years.

00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:57.070
I want to be an upperclassman my juniors can depend on,

00:07:57.070 --> 00:08:00.080
but I don't know what to do.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:04.100
I think you're fine just the way you are, Yuno-san.

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:06.590
You'll wear yourself out if you're too eager.

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:09.300
Relax, relax!

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:11.300
Sensei...

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:13.960
The third-years are coming back tomorrow,

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.310
so we'll be back to our lively selves!

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:18.310
I'm looking forward to the souvenirs they'll bring back!

00:08:19.290 --> 00:08:20.090
Me too!

00:08:24.760 --> 00:08:26.830
This is amazing!

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:30.940
The Goryoukaku Fort <i>does</i> have a pretty star shape!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.110
What do you think, Sae?

00:08:32.790 --> 00:08:33.530
Sae?

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.820
Checking out souvenirs?

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.370
Oh, Hiro, I'm looking at these,

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:43.370
but there aren't any spoons with Yuno's and Nazuna's names on them!

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:45.460
Would you buy them if they had them?

00:08:45.460 --> 00:08:47.880
Well, I wouldn't, but still...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.950
Since we came all the way up here, we should look at the scenery.

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:54.130
You're right.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.870
Wow, it's so scary looking down from here!

00:08:58.870 --> 00:09:00.050
Hiro, come look!

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.140
It's so thrilling!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.980
I'm not sure how much weight this can bear.

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:09.860
Sae!

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.930
That's not what I meant!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.630
Come here! It's fun!

00:09:14.630 --> 00:09:15.700
I'm not going there!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.860
Sorry!

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:17.910
Come here.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:28.920
Sae, if you stand there, people can see your panties from below!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:37.990
I'm just kidding!

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.750
Let me light the fire.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.810
Please take the lid off when it goes out.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:52.020
Okay!

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:03.200
I... I think yours are ready to eat.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.680
You think so?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.700
Wow, it smells great!

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:10.580
So this is ishikari-nabe.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:14.460
The salmon is so tender!

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:17.720
These squid noodles are so clear and pretty!

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:20.000
It's all so fresh and delicious!

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.820
I'm in heaven!

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:24.720
I feel a little bad that we're the only ones who get to eat this great food.

00:10:25.240 --> 00:10:27.600
I wish Yuno-san and other girls could join us.

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.160
Yeah.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.260
We should come back here with everyone when we're grown up.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:32.820
That sounds wonderful!

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:34.860
Let's come here again, all six of us!

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:41.550
I've decided!

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:43.210
I'm taking everyone to Masanoyu Bathhouse!

00:10:43.210 --> 00:10:44.370
Ooh!

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:48.120
Why don't we go to a bathhouse today?

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:51.920
Don't forget to bring bath and hand towels, and a sponge with you!

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:56.270
Masanoyu Bathhouse is about a
fifteen-minute walk away from here.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:57.510
Masanoyu Bathhouse...

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.880
Yunocchi, wait a sec!

00:10:59.240 --> 00:10:59.880
Huh?

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:13.770
We're here!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:18.080
"Yuno-sama"?!

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.030
Perfect!

00:11:25.600 --> 00:11:27.040
Oh, welcome!

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.760
And these are my last hundred yen!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.640
You're drinking it <i>before</i> you get in?!

00:11:43.060 --> 00:11:45.060
Miya-chan, wait!

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:48.310
We're getting in the bath, then.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.800
It's my first time at a bathhouse.

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.860
Have you ever been here, Nazuna?

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:53.610
No.

00:11:53.610 --> 00:11:56.070
I knew there was a bathhouse,

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.900
but it's my first time here, too.

00:11:59.070 --> 00:12:02.200
You need to take this off before getting in the bath anyway!

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:08.460
She's so persistent!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.480
This place is so big!

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:14.410
We practically have the whole place to ourselves.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.970
We lucked out.

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:21.770
What's there to be so embarrassed about?

00:12:21.770 --> 00:12:23.480
It's not like you're out of shape.

00:12:24.100 --> 00:12:28.270
But I don't have any curves. I'm just flat.

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:33.310
From a sketch artist's point of view, you might be tough to draw.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.530
What do you mean?

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:39.190
A model with gentle curves can be tougher

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:42.990
to portray perspective than a fat old lady.

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:48.420
In short, Sae-san is hard to draw, and Hiro-san is easy.

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.040
What are you saying?

00:12:53.040 --> 00:12:56.720
I was embarrassed of being naked at first too.

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:59.230
I got used to it after visiting here a few times.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:02.300
Oh, it was embarrassing for you, too, Yuno-senpai?

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.260
Yeah!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.900
It'd be weird if I were the only one naked,

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.300
but everyone's naked here!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.070
It's the same for everyone, so there's nothing to worry about!

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.020
I see!

00:13:11.020 --> 00:13:14.020
Well, there <i>are</i> some differences, though.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.030
Don't just sit there!

00:13:16.030 --> 00:13:17.460
Get in here!

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:20.450
"Some" doesn't even begin to describe it.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.080
Wow!

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:31.520
Can I touch your boobs, Miyako-san?

00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:32.830
Oh, go ahead.

00:13:33.840 --> 00:13:37.130
Wow, they're so squishy!

00:13:37.940 --> 00:13:39.840
Can I touch them, too?

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.090
Then, me too...

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:47.100
Never mind.

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:52.520
Today's the last day Hidamari Apartments' average age is younger than usual.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:56.620
Miya-chan, they'd be angry if they had heard that.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:59.760
Say, Yuno-san, it may a bit late to ask,

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:03.240
but why did you suggest coming to the bathhouse?

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:05.430
Well...

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.990
Nori-chan, did you enjoy it?

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.870
I sure did!

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:12.500
It's my first time coming to a place like this.

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:13.940
I see.

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.250
That's great!

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:20.870
Sae-san and Hiro-san are both so kind and dependable.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.760
Yep! God bless them for being such great people.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:28.400
Yeah, Sae-san is so cool, and she works hard at her job...

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:30.750
...and Hiro-san is a great cook.

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:32.520
Warm-hearted and reliable too.

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.740
They're like a mom and dad!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:35.860
Yeah, exactly!

00:14:36.410 --> 00:14:40.360
The third-years have done so much for us,

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:44.220
so I wanted to do something for you guys, too.

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:47.370
Since I'm the upperclassman now.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:51.520
Huh? What is it?

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:54.000
Well, it's just...

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.810
What was that?

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:01.920
You even act alike.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.470
That was a great bath!

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:14.140
That really warmed me up.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:17.150
I had so much fun in that huge bath!

00:15:17.710 --> 00:15:18.980
Let's come again sometime!

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:20.230
Yep!

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:23.800
This is the first time all four of us have walked together at night.

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:25.240
It's a new feeling.

00:15:27.060 --> 00:15:28.860
The stars are so pretty!

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:32.040
I wonder if the night sky is clear in Hokkaido too.

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:35.100
They should have fewer city lights,

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.550
so I'm sure the night sky looks even more beautiful there!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.040
Oh!

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:41.330
Yunocchi, do you have your phone with you?

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:43.080
Can I call Hokkaido?

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.050
Sure!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:47.540
Hello, Sae-san?

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:50.040
Hi! Where's Hiro-san?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.840
Hiro's drying her hair in the dressing room.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:53.750
I see.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:55.600
Then, please pass on a message for me.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:58.610
Thank you for everything you do.

00:15:58.610 --> 00:15:59.730
Huh?

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:01.360
Where did that come from?

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:04.150
I love stuff like dried scallops!

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:10.410
Yeah, yeah, all right.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:12.140
Dried scallops, huh?

00:16:12.140 --> 00:16:13.120
See you tomorrow.

00:16:13.520 --> 00:16:14.480
<i>Sae!</i>

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.490
Were you talking on the phone with the Hidamari Apartments girls?

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:19.020
Oh, Natsume!

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:19.690
Yeah.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.780
It must be nice to live at Hidamari Apartments!

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:24.380
Nice? How so?

00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:26.340
How so?

00:16:26.340 --> 00:16:28.370
Well, it's close to school,

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:30.140
and everyone seems so cheerful there.

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.720
Then, why don't you come over?

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.310
Right...

00:16:35.310 --> 00:16:36.120
Yeah.

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:42.600
Wow, the scenery is gorgeous!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.490
It makes our last night all the more special.

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:47.420
Our last day...

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:49.490
Our field trip is almost over.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:51.930
We only have one more year together as a class.

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:53.200
Hey, stop that!

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:54.740
You're gonna make me cry!

00:16:54.740 --> 00:16:58.610
B-But we haven't even started studying for university entrance exams!

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:00.250
We still have a long way to go!

00:17:00.650 --> 00:17:03.320
That also makes me want to cry.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.430
Events like the Yamabuki Festival and the Sports Festival...

00:17:11.070 --> 00:17:15.600
After this year, we won't be able to do them as high school students anymore.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:20.020
Sae, you asleep?

00:17:20.020 --> 00:17:22.210
Yeah, I'm looking forward to them.

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:23.110
Huh?

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:27.110
I'm looking forward to all those school events.

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:32.860
Jeez...

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:39.960
I had so much fun today!

00:17:40.510 --> 00:17:44.250
<i>If Sae-san and Hiro-san are the mom and dad...</i>

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.300
<i>I want to be a good big sister.</i>

00:17:47.960 --> 00:17:51.160
Don't you think Yuno-san is kinda cute?

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.470
Yeah!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.470
"Yuno... onee-chan."

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:09.830
That was so fun!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.160
We really enjoyed that trip to the fullest!

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:15.390
Yeah, I feel like I really know Hokkaido now.

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:16.870
You think so?

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:20.620
Look! We've only been around this area of the island.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:22.370
Huh?

00:18:23.070 --> 00:18:27.130
<i>Hokkaido really </i>is<i> huge, huh?</i>

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:39.180
Sae-san! Hiro-san!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.810
Guys, we're back!

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.770
Were you waiting here the whole time?

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.890
We came out when we heard the bus.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.500
Welcome back!

00:18:57.380 --> 00:19:00.310
Aren't these usually for visitors?

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:06.460
Seriously, Hokkaido was so fun!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.240
We did a lot of things.

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:10.250
We rode horses and blew glass.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.470
You went to a farm?

00:19:12.470 --> 00:19:13.360
We did!

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:14.760
We saw an alpaca.

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:18.760
It was so cute with its round eyes and fluffy fur!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:21.520
I wanna see alpaca too.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:25.020
Oh, I should show you this video!

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.740
Hey, Hiro!

00:19:29.740 --> 00:19:31.400
Sae-san looks like she's having so much fun!

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:32.280
Yeah, isn't she?

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:34.410
Jeez.

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:35.410
What's wrong?

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:37.280
They're memories of the fun times we had.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:40.220
Did you have any of Hokkaido's famous cuisine?

00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:42.040
Potatoes with butter? Crabs?

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:46.290
Oh, we had really delicious omelet with rice on the first day!

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:49.750
Oh yeah, that was really delicious!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:51.800
I wish you could've been there for it.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:55.050
<i>You went to Hokkaido, and you ate </i>omelet with rice<i>?!</i>

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:58.430
Before I forget, I have souvenirs for you guys.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:19:59.800
Yay!

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.100
Dried scallops.

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:04.810
Thanks, Sae-san, Hiro-san!

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:06.310
Good for you, Miya-chan!

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:09.310
There's also potato sticks, butter sandwich cookies, and...

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.880
Oh yeah, this one too!

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.320
Why don't we try these right now?

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:16.460
Jingisukan-flavored caramel?

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:17.820
What's a jingisukan?

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:20.630
It's a grilled mutton dish, I think.

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:21.830
Interesting!

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.840
They said it's a popular souvenir.

00:20:24.840 --> 00:20:27.580
Everyone was buying them, so we bought one too.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:30.500
A snack and grilled meat in one!

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.630
That sounds amazing!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:40.020
Let's try it!

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:45.890
What am I eating?

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:50.270
I'm thankful for the souvenir, but this flavor is a bit too much.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:53.270
Is this what jingisukan tastes like?

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.320
I've never had it, so I don't know.

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:57.700
Me neither.

00:20:57.700 --> 00:21:01.420
It's a very mysterious flavor with some garlic and onion thrown in.

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:04.100
Jingisukan must be a delicious dish!

00:21:04.100 --> 00:21:06.560
You can have the rest if you'd like.

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:07.710
Okay!

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:15.300
So how were things while we were away?

00:21:15.300 --> 00:21:17.590
We lived!

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.790
Miyako-san's boobs were amazing.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:21.720
What?

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:25.600
Yuno-san took us to a bathhouse.

00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:26.640
Oh?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:29.570
Because Nori-chan and I had never been to one before.

00:21:29.570 --> 00:21:30.980
We had a lot of fun!

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:35.530
We talked a lot with Yuno-senpai and Miyako-senpai!

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:36.510
Right?

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:37.490
Yeah!

00:21:46.110 --> 00:21:51.500
I feel like Hidamari Apartments is finally back to normal with Sae-san and Hiro-san back.

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:55.460
Huh?

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:57.650
I'm sort of relieved.

00:21:59.550 --> 00:22:03.000
I feel like I need to become more mature like an upperclassman,

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:07.020
but being Sae-san's and Hiro-san's junior is nice too.

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:13.220
How did you finish your summer break homework?

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.040
My picture diaries and workbooks?

00:22:15.040 --> 00:22:17.700
I set aside time every day to do a little bit of it.

00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:19.040
That's amazing, Nori-chan!

00:22:19.040 --> 00:22:20.320
How about you, Yunocchi?

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:22.160
I did all of it over the last two days.

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:24.020
I don't remember doing it.

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:25.460
Huh? How come?

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:27.560
Oh, I finished it in July!

00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:28.860
Wow!

00:22:28.860 --> 00:22:35.400
Next episode is "August 31st, The Last Visitor of Summer Break" and "September 1st, Okashimochi"!

00:22:35.400 --> 00:22:38.880
We'll be waiting at the Hidamari Apartment, so come visit us!
